sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Backend as 后端物理输出
    participant Store as SessionStore
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Timeline as PlaybackTimeline
    participant Audio as Audio sink
    participant Motion as Motion sink
    participant Live2D as Live2D runtime
    participant UI as 可见文本

    rect rgb(239, 246, 249)
        Note over Backend,UI: Record 先到，Plain 正文晚到
        Backend->>Store: output.audio(caption_text)
        Backend->>Store: motion_intent
        Store->>Store: caption 只写 audio.captionText<br/>不创建可见正文
        Store->>Orch: text delivered marker + audio + motion ready
        Orch->>Timeline: release audio + motion
        Timeline->>Audio: start
        Timeline->>Motion: register, wait for audio clock
        Backend->>Store: output.text(visible reply)
        Store->>Orch: textReady, alreadyReleased=false
        Orch->>UI: late text only
        Note over Orch,Timeline: 不重放 audio / motion
    end

    rect rgb(253, 239, 235)
        Note over Backend,UI: TTS 被声明为 expected，但 3000ms 内未到
        Backend->>Store: output.text(audio_expected=true)
        Store->>Orch: audio expected
        Orch->>Orch: wait 3000ms
        Orch->>Store: audio terminal=failed
        Orch->>Motion: mark failed, 不启动 motion-only
        Orch->>UI: release visible text
        Note over Orch,UI: failed 不伪装成 absent
    end

    rect rgb(247, 241, 230)
        Note over Backend,UI: 音频失败后 Plain 正文才到
        Audio-->>Timeline: failed
        Timeline-->>Store: audio failed
        Store->>Orch: audioFailed=true
        Backend->>Store: late output.text
        Store->>Orch: late text ready
        Orch->>UI: release late text only
        Orch-xAudio: 禁止晚到音频重放
        Orch-xMotion: 禁止晚到动作启动
    end

    rect rgb(235, 244, 232)
        Note over Backend,UI: Live2D 模型在异步加载期间被替换
        Timeline->>Motion: interrupt old segment
        Motion->>Live2D: stop old run / replace model
        Live2D->>Live2D: cancel old load generation
        Live2D->>Live2D: release old Cubism managers
        Live2D->>Live2D: begin new generation
        Note over Live2D: 旧 fetch / texture / motion callback<br/>代际校验失败后退出
    end
